data: {"id": "ae5656e3102345bb-final", "run_id": "ae5656e3102345bb", "seq": 2524, "ts_ms": 1789381270300, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v15/workload` | CrashLoopBackOff | aiops-case-v15/workload 处于 CrashLoopBackOff 状态 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Kubernetes | 容器 `app` 终止原因为 `OOMKilled`，退出码 `137` (`fact-3a21cdd1f6f1`, `fact-198f6d9dda89`) | 确认进程被内核 OOM 杀手终止 |\n| 2 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `app` 容器配置 `memory_limit=64Mi`，状态 `CrashLoopBackOff` (`fact-2567d581cd9b`, `fact-dd6571702875`) | 确定触发终止的资源上限与当前异常状态 |\n| 3 | Logging | Elasticsearch | 启动日志: `startup allocation 256Mi` (`fact-545e18f06a78`) | 证实应用启动时内存需求远超硬限制 |\n| 4 | Metric | Prometheus | `reason=OOMKilled` 且 `sample_count=1` (`fact-3084eed7ed05`) | 独立确认终止原因为 OOM |\n| 5 | Metric | Prometheus | `container_memory_working_set_bytes` 当前值为 `3334144` bytes (约 3.18 MiB) (`fact-5c1ad41b0c21`) | 采样点仅反映 Pod 重启后重启初期的低水位状态 |\n| 6 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `Warning BackOff 3m14s (x235 over 53m)` (`fact-e12a149092b8`) | 说明 CrashLoop 持续较长时间，频繁触发重启 |\n\n**证据互证说明**：\nKubernetes 状态（证据 1、2）直接记录了容器被 OOMKilled 和因 CrashLoopBackOff 重启的事实，并指出 `memory_limit` 仅为 `64Mi`。Elasticsearch 日志（证据 3）从应用内部视角证实了启动时的显式分配量 `256Mi`，解释了为何 `64Mi` 的硬限制会导致 OOM。Prometheus 指标（证据 4）从监控系统侧独立验证了 `OOMKilled` 原因。由于 `oom_killed` 指标在采样点 `sample_count=1` 时仅为状态确认（证据 5），因此 OOM 事实主要依赖 K8s 状态和日志的证据闭环。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n配置 memory limit (64Mi) 过低 → 启动代码强制分配 256 MiB 内存 → 触发 OOMKilled (Exit Code 137) → Pod 进入 CrashLoopBackOff\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因是**容器内存限制设置过低**。Kubernetes 配置中 `app` 容器的 `memory limit` 硬限制为 `64Mi`（见证据 2），而应用启动日志明确显示其尝试分配 `256MiB` 内存（见证据 3）。这一内存需求超过了内核为该容器划定的硬限制，导致 Kubelet/OOM-Killer 直接终止进程（Exit Code 137，见证据 1），从而引发 `CrashLoopBackOff`（见证据 2）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 2.0m\n├─ 问题定位: 18.2s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 91.0s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v15/workload: 91.0s (Evidence 82.0s, RCA 8.8s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 11.2s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v15/workload**: pod-crashloop-runtime, pod-oomkilled, pod-config-error\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 120.385, "metrics": {"run_id": "ae5656e3102345bb", "mttr": {"value": "2.0m", "seconds": 120.38761448860168, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "39%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-oomkilled, pod-config-error, pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 120387.61448860168, "llm_calls": 11, "llm_duration_ms": 98048.22492599487, "tool_calls": 21, "executed_tool_calls": 18, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 3, "successful_tool_calls": 21, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 81848.71196746826, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 21832.975149154663}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 18151.62491798401, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 90965.5408859253, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 11243.736028671265, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

